    "turn_text": "Hi, I'm James Lilax, co-host of the Ricochet Podcast. Podcast you're about to listen to is a production of Ricochet.com, the home of center-right conversation about politics and culture on the web. If you've been listening to these podcasts for a while, you've probably heard about this site. Maybe you've even visited once or twice. Well, now I'm here to make you a special offer to join this growing community of civil and clever conversationalists and interact with contributors such as myself, Rob Long, Peter Robinson, John U, Richard Epstein, Pat Sajak, Mona Charon, so many more. In addition, you can create your own posts on our vibrant and lively and widely-read member feed on any topic, culture, politics, sports, and food you name it. Interact with like-minded conservatives from around the country and across the world. Listen to the podcast as they're being recorded live and live chat with your fellow members at the same time. Even attend in-person meetups around the country. Quite simply, it's the best community on the web and the most fun you can have with a keyboard. Join Ricochet today and get a free 30-day membership. Go to ricochet.com slash offer now. That's of course ricochet.com slash offer and claim your free 30-day membership on me. Now on to the show and we'll see you in the comments at Ricochet 2.0.",
