    "turn_text": "Yeah, you know, the best cure I found for something like that is get going. Don't look back. And it's so mentally harmful for you to look back. Oh, I should have could have would have. And there's so many things that obviously I could find that if I had had the ability to do over again, I would have done it differently and all that. was so fortunate to have the United States Senate and to be able to jump back into the fray, whether it be my dear friends like you or whether it be Ted Kennedy who I just spoke at his thing the other day and all I would",
